# graphify — regenerable local cache & per-run churn.
# manifest.json / GRAPH_REPORT.md / .graphify_labels.json stay tracked; graph.json
# is ignored (too large for GitHub, ~83MB) and rebuilt locally by `graphify update`.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/**/*.tmp
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/graph.json
# dated per-run snapshot folders, e.g. graphify-out/2026-06-23/
graphify-out/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
